{
  "title": "Ziyarat of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) from a Distance",
  "data": "Ziyarat from a Distance\nAway from Madinah, do ghusl, then shape something like a grave (of earth or the like) and write the name of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) on it. Turn your heart towards him and say:\nاَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nASH-HADU AN LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nI bear witness that there is no god save Allah, alone without having any associate,\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُوْلُهٗ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNA MUHAMMADAN A'BDUHOO WA RASOOLUH\nand I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger,\nوَاَنَّهٗ سَيِّدُ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nWA ANNAHOO SAYYIDUL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nthat he is the chief of the ancient and the coming generations,\nوَاَنَّهٗ سَيِّدُ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَالْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA ANNAHOO SAYYIDUL ANBIYAA'I WAL MURSALEEN\nand that he is the chief of all Prophets and Messengers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلٰۤى اَهْلِ بَيْتِهِ الْاَئِمَّةِ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAYHI WA A'LAA AHLI BAYTIHIL A'IMMATIT TAYYIBEEN\nO Allah, send blessings upon him and upon his Household, the Immaculate Imams.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA RASOOLALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَلِيْلَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA KHALEELALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَبِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NABIYYALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَفِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAFIYYALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Choice of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَحْمَةَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA RAHMATALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Mercy of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خِيَرَةَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA KHIYARATALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Well-Chosen by Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَبِيْبَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HABEEBALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Most Beloved by Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَجِيْبَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NAJEEBALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Selected by Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَاتَمَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA KHAATAMAN NABIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O Seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAYYIDAL MURSALEEN\nPeace be upon you, O Master of the Messengers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا قَاۤئِمًا بِالْقِسْطِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA QAA'IMAN BIL QIST\nPeace be upon you, O Maintainer of justice.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا فَاتِحَ الْخَيْرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA FAATIHAL KHAYR\nPeace be upon you, O introducer of goodliness.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَعْدِنَ الْوَحْيِ وَالتَّنْزِيْلِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MA'DINAL WAHYI WAT TANZEEL\nPeace be upon you, O core of Divine Inspiration and Revelation.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُبَلِّغًا عَنِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MUBALLIGHAN A'NILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O conveyor on behalf of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا السِّرَاجُ الْمُنِيْرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAS SIRAAJUL MUNEER\nPeace be upon you, O light-giving torch.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُبَشِّرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MUBASHSHIR\nPeace be upon you, O conveyor of good tidings (to the believers).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَذِيْرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NADHEER\nPeace be upon you, O warner (against Allah’s chastisement).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُنْذِرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MUNDHIR\nPeace be upon you, O he who warns (against violating Allah’s commands).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ اللّٰهِ الَّذِيْ يُسْتَضَاۤءُ بِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NOORALLAAHIL LADHEE YUSTADAA'U BIH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s Light that spreads luminosity.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلٰۤى اَهْلِ بَيْتِكَ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA WA A'LAA AHLI BAYTIKAT TAYYIBEEN\nPeace be upon you and upon your Household,\nالطَّاهِرِيْنَ الْهَادِيْنَ الْمَهْدِيِّيْنَ\nAT-TAAHIREENAL HAADEENAL MAHDIYYEEN\nthe pure, immaculate, guides, and rightly guided.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلٰى جَدِّكَ عَبْدِ الْمُطَّلِبِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA WA A'LAA JADDIKA A'BDIL MUTTALIB\nPeace be upon you and upon your grandfather, 'Abd al-Muttalib,\nوَعَلٰۤى اَبِيْكَ عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ\nWA A'LAA ABEEKA A'BDILLAAH\nand upon your father, 'Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰۤى اُمِّكَ اٰمِنَةَ بِنْتِ وَهْبٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA UMMIKA AAMINATA BINTI WAHB\nPeace be upon your mother, Aminah the daughter of Wahb.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى عَمِّكَ حَمْزَةَ سَيِّدِ الشُّهَدَاۤءِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA A'MMIKA HAMZATA SAYYIDISH SHUHADAA'\nPeace be upon your (paternal) uncle, Hamzah, the master of martyrs.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى عَمِّكَ الْعَبَّاسِ بْنِ عَبْدِ الْمُطَّلِبِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA A'MMIKAL A'BBAASIBNI A'BDIL MUTTALIB\nPeace be upon your uncle, al-'Abbas the son of 'Abd al-Muttalib.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى عَمِّكَ وَكَفِيْلِكَ اَبِيْ طَالِبٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA A'MMIKA WA KAFEELIKA ABEE TAALIB\nPeace be upon your uncle and your guardian, Abu Talib.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى ابْنِ عَمِّكَ جَعْفَرٍ الطَّيَّارِ فِيْ جِنَانِ الْخُلْدِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LABNI A'MMIKA JA'FARINIT TAYYAARI FEE JINAANIL KHULD\nPeace be upon your cousin, Ja'far, who flies in the gardens of the Paradise of Eternity.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُحَمَّدُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MUHAMMAD\nPeace be upon you, O Muhammad (the praised).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَاۤ اَحْمَدُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA AHMAD\nPeace be upon you, O Ahmad (the more praised).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ عَلَى الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAHI A'LAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nPeace be upon you, O Argument of Allah against the past and coming generations,\nوَالسَّابِقَ اِلٰى طَاعَةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWAS SAABIQA ILAA TAA'ATI RABBIL A'ALAMEEN\nforemost to the obedience to the Lord of the worlds,\nوَالْمُهَيْمِنَ عَلٰى رُسُلِهٖ وَالْخَاتِمَ لِاَنْبِيَاۤئِهٖ\nWAL MUHAYMINA A'LAA RUSULIHEE WAL KHAATIMA LI-ANBIYAA'IH\nprevailing over His Messengers, last of His Prophets,\nوَالشَّاهِدَ عَلٰى خَلْقِهٖ وَالشَّفِيْعَ اِلَيْهِ\nWASH SHAAHIDA A'LAA KHALQIHEE WASH SHAFEE'A ILAYH\nwitness over all His creatures, interceder to Him,\nوَالْمَكِيْنَ لَدَيْهِ وَالْمُطَاعَ فِيْ مَلَكُوْتِهِ\nWAL MAKEENA LADAYHI WAL MUTAA'A FEE MALAKOOTIH\nfirmly established with Him, obeyed in His Kingdom,\nالْاَحْمَدَ مِنَ الْاَوْصَافِ\nAL-AHMADA MINAL AWSAAF\nwinner of the most praised qualities,\nالْمُحَمَّدَ لِسَاۤئِرِ الْاَشْرَافِ\nAL-MUHAMMADA LISAA'IRIL ASHRAAF\nholder of the most praised honors,\nالْكَرِيْمَ عِنْدَ الرَّبِّ\nAL-KAREEMA I'NDAR RABB\nhonored by the Lord,\nوَالْمُكَلَّمَ مِنْ وَرَاۤءِ الْحُجُبِ\nWAL MUKALLAMA MIN WARAA'IL HUJUB\naddressee (by Almighty Allah) from behind the (Divine) Veils,\nالْفَاۤئِزَ بِالسِّبَاقِ وَالْفَاۤئِتَ عَنِ اللِّحَاقِ\nAL-FAA'IZA BIS SIBAAQI WAL FAA'ITA A'NIL LIHAAQ\nmost advanced in position, and unovertakable.\nتَسْلِيْمَ عَارِفٍ بِحَقِّكَ\nTASLEEMA A'ARIFIN BIHAQQIK\nI greet you with the greeting of him who acknowledges your right (that is incumbent upon us),\nمُعْتَرِفٍ بِالتَّقْصِيْرِ فِيْ قِيَامِهٖ بِوَاجِبِكَ\nMU'TARIFIN BIT TAQSEERI FEE QIYAAMIHEE BIWAAJIBIK\nwho confesses of his shortcoming in carrying out his duty towards you,\nغَيْرِ مُنْكِرٍ مَا انْتَهٰىۤ اِلَيْهِ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ\nGHAYRI MUNKIRIN MAN TAHAA ILAYHI MIN FADLIK\nwho does not deny the virtues of yours that have reached him,\nمُوْقِنٍ بِالْمَزِيْدَاتِ مِنْ رَبِّكَ\nMOOQININ BIL MAZEEDAATI MIN RABBIK\nwho is sure that you will have more rewards from your Lord,\nمُؤْمِنٍ بِالْكِتَابِ الْمُنْزَلِ عَلَيْكَ\nMU'MININ BIL KITAABIL MUNZALI A'LAYK\nwho believes in the Book that was revealed to you,\nمُحَلِّلٍ حَلَالَكَ مُحَرِّمٍ حَرَامَكَ\nMUHALLILIN HALAALAKA MUHARRIMIN HARAAMAK\nwho deems lawful all that which you deemed lawful, and who deems unlawful all that which you deemed unlawful.\nاَشْهَدُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ مَعَ كُلِّ شَاهِدٍ\nASH-HADU YAA RASOOLALLAAHI MA'A KULLI SHAAHID\nO Messenger of Allah, I bear witness, with everyone who bears witness,\nوَاَتَحَمَّلُهَا عَنْ كُلِّ جَاحِدٍ\nWA ATAHAMMALUHAA A'N KULLI JAAHID\nand I bear witness on behalf of everyone who denies it,\nاَنَّكَ قَدْ بَلَّغْتَ رِسَالَاتِ رَبِّكَ\nANNAKA QAD BALLAGHTA RISAALAATI RABBIK\nthat you conveyed the messages of your Lord (flawlessly),\nوَنَصَحْتَ لِاُمَّتِكَ\nWA NASAHTA LI-UMMATIK\noffered your nation good advice,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِيْ سَبِيْلِ رَبِّكَ\nWA JAAHADTA FEE SABEELI RABBIK\nstrove in the way of your Lord,\nوَصَدَعْتَ بِاَمْرِهٖ وَاحْتَمَلْتَ الْاَذٰى فِيْ جَنْبِهٖ\nWA SADA'TA BI-AMRIHEE WAHTAMALTAL ADHAA FEE JANBIH\nexpounded openly what you were commanded to convey, stood harm for the sake of Him,\nوَدَعَوْتَ اِلٰى سَبِيْلِهٖ بِالْحِكْمَةِ\nWA DA'AWTA ILAA SABEELIHEE BIL HIKMAH\ncalled to the way of Him with wisdom\nوَالْمَوْعِظَةِ الْحَسَنَةِ الْجَمِيْلَةِ\nWAL MAW'IZATIL HASANATIL JAMEELAH\nand fair, excellent exhortation,\nوَاَدَّيْتَ الْحَقَّ الَّذِيْ كَانَ عَلَيْكَ\nWA ADDAYTAL HAQQAL LADHEE KAANA A'LAYK\nand fulfilled the duty with which you were commissioned;\nوَاَنَّكَ قَدْ رَؤُفْتَ بِالْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nWA ANNAKA QAD RA'UFTA BIL MU'MINEEN\nand that you were compassionate to the believers,\nوَغَلُظْتَ عَلَى الْكَافِرِيْنَ\nWA GHALUZTA A'LAL KAAFIREEN\nstrong against the unbelievers,\nوَعَبَدْتَ اللّٰهَ مُخْلِصًا حَتّٰىۤ اَتَاكَ الْيَقِيْنُ\nWA A'BADTALLAAHA MUKHLISAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEEN\nand you worshipped Allah sincerely until death came upon you.\nفَبَلَغَ اللّٰهُ بِكَ اَشْرَفَ مَحَلِّ الْمُكَرَّمِيْنَ\nFABALAGHALLAAHU BIKA ASHRAFA MAHALLIL MUKARRAMEEN\nTherefore, Almighty Allah has exalted you to the most honorable position of the ennobled ones,\nوَاَعْلٰى مَنَازِلِ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nWA A'LAA MANAAZILIL MUQARRABEEN\nto the most elevated place of the intimate servants of Him,\nوَاَرْفَعَ دَرَجَاتِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA ARFA'A DARAJAATIL MURSALEEN\nand to the most exalted ranks of the Messengers,\nحَيْثُ لَا يَلْحَقُكَ لَاحِقٌ\nHAYTHU LAA YALHAQUKA LAAHIQ\nwhere none can come up with you,\nوَلَا يَفُوْقُكَ فَاۤئِقٌ وَلَا يَسْبِقُكَ سَابِقٌ\nWA LAA YAFOOQUKA FAA'IQUN WA LAA YASBIQUKA SAABIQ\nnone can excel you, none can overtake you,\nوَلَا يَطْمَعُ فِيْۤ اِدْرَاكِكَ طَامِعٌ\nWA LAA YATMA'U FEE IDRAAKIKA TAAMI'\nand none can even think of obtaining your rank.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْ اسْتَنْقَذَنَا بِكَ مِنَ الْهَلَكَةِ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHIS TANQADHANAA BIKA MINAL HALAKAH\nAll praise be to Allah Who saved us from perdition through you,\nوَهَدَانَا بِكَ مِنَ الضَّلَالَةِ\nWA HADAANAA BIKA MINAD DALAALAH\nWho guided us off misdirection through you,\nوَنَوَّرَنَا بِكَ مِنَ الظُّلْمَةِ\nWA NAWWARANAA BIKA MINAZ ZULMAH\nand Who lit our darkness through you.\nفَجَزَاكَ اللّٰهُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ مِنْ مَبْعُوْثٍ\nFAJAZAAKALLAAHU YAA RASOOLALLAAHI MIN MAB'OOTH\nO Messenger of Allah, may Allah reward you, for you are His envoy,\nاَفْضَلَ مَا جَازَى نَبِيًّا عَنْ اُمَّتِهٖ\nAFDALA MAA JAAZAA NABIYYAN A'N UMMATIH\nwith the best rewarding that He has ever conferred upon a prophet on behalf of his people\nوَرَسُوْلًا عَمَّنْ اُرْسِلَ اِلَيْهِ\nWA RASOOLAN A'MMAN URSILA ILAYH\nor a messenger on behalf of those to whom He has sent him.\nبِاَبِيْۤ اَنْتَ وَاُمِّيْ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ\nBI-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA RASOOLALLAAH\nMay Allah accept my father and my mother as ransoms for you, O Messenger of Allah.\nزُرْتُكَ عَارِفًا بِحَقِّكَ مُقِرًّا بِفَضْلِكَ\nZURTUKA A'ARIFAN BIHAQQIKA MUQIRRAN BIFADLIK\nI am visiting you, for I acknowledge your right (that is incumbent upon us) and I confess of your superiority,\nمُسْتَبْصِرًا بِضَلَالَةِ مَنْ خَالَفَكَ وَخَالَفَ اَهْلَ بَيْتِكَ\nMUSTABSIRAN BIDALAALATI MAN KHAALAFAKA WA KHAALAFA AHLA BAYTIK\nI know for sure about the straying off (from the right path) of those who dissent from you and from your Household,\nعَارِفًا بِالْهُدَى الَّذِيْۤ اَنْتَ عَلَيْهِ\nA'ARIFAN BIL HUDAL LADHEE ANTA A'LAYH\nand I admit the true guidance that you follow (and lead to).\nبِاَبِيْۤ اَنْتَ وَاُمِّيْ وَنَفْسِيْ وَاَهْلِيْ وَمَالِيْ وَوَلَدِيْۤ\nBI-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE WA NAFSEE WA AHLEE WA MAALEE WA WALADEE\nMay Allah accept my father, my mother, me, my family, my property, and my sons as ransoms for you!\nاَنَا اُصَلِّيْ عَلَيْكَ كَمَا صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ\nANAA USALLEE A'LAYKA KAMAA SALLALLAAHU A'LAYK\nLet me invoke Almighty Allah’s blessings upon you in the same way as Allah did send blessings upon you,\nوَصَلَّى عَلَيْكَ مَلَاۤئِكَتُهٗ وَاَنْبِيَاؤُهٗ وَرُسُلُهٗ\nWA SALLAA A'LAYKA MALAA'IKATUHOO WA ANBIYAA'UHOO WA RUSULUH\nand so did His angels, Prophets, and Messengers;\nصَلَاةً مُتَتَابِعَةً وَافِرَةً مُتَوَاصِلَةً\nSALAATAN MUTATAABI'ATAN WAAFIRATAN MUTAWAASILAH\nsuch blessings that are consecutive, abundant, continuous,\nلَا انْقِطَاعَ لَهَا وَلَاۤ اَمَدَ وَلَاۤ اَجَلَ\nLAN QITAA'A LAHAA WA LAA AMADA WA LAA AJAL\nincessant, infinite, and unlimited.\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلٰۤى اَهْلِ بَيْتِكَ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYKA WA A'LAA AHLI BAYTIK\nMay Allah send blessings upon you and upon your Household,\nالطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ كَمَاۤ اَنْتُمْ اَهْلُهٗ\nAT-TAYYIBEENAT TAAHIREENA KAMAA ANTUM AHLUH\nthe pure and immaculate, as much as you deserve.\nRaise your hands and say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْ جَوَامِعَ صَلَوَاتِكَ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'L JAWAAMI'A SALAWAATIK\nO Allah, (please do) make Your complete blessings,\nوَنَوَامِيَ بَرَكَاتِكَ وَفَوَاضِلَ خَيْرَاتِكَ\nWA NAWAAMIYA BARAKAATIKA WA FAWAADILA KHAYRAATIK\nYour perfect benedictions, Your most virtuous boons,\nوَشَرَاۤئِفَ تَحِيَّاتِكَ\nWA SHARAA'IFA TAHIYYAATIK\nand Your most honorable greetings,\nوَتَسْلِيْمَاتِكَ وَكَرَامَاتِكَ وَرَحَمَاتِكَ\nWA TASLEEMAATIKA WA KARAAMAATIKA WA RAHAMAATIK\nsalutations, dignities, and mercy,\nوَصَلَوَاتِ مَلَاۤئِكَتِكَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nWA SALAWAATI MALAA'IKATIKAL MUQARRABEEN\nas well as the blessings of Your archangels,\nوَاَنْبِيَاۤئِكَ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ وَاَئِمَّتِكَ الْمُنْتَجَبِيْنَ\nWA ANBIYAA'IKAL MURSALEENA WA A'IMMATIKAL MUNTAJABEEN\nYour commissioned Prophets, Your elite Imams,\nوَعِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِيْنَ وَاَهْلِ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْاَرَضِيْنَ\nWA I'BAADIKAS SAALIHEENA WA AHLIS SAMAAWAATI WAL ARADEEN\nYour righteous servants, the inhabitants of the heavens and the earth,\nوَمَنْ سَبَّحَ لَكَ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ مِنَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nWA MAN SABBAHA LAKA YAA RABBAL A'ALAMEENA MINAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nand (the blessings of) everyone who glorified You, O Lord of the worlds, from the past and the coming generations,\nعَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ عَبْدِكَ وَرَسُوْلِكَ\nA'LAA MUHAMMADIN A'BDIKA WA RASOOLIK\nmake all these pour forth upon Muhammad, Your servant, Your messenger,\nوَشَاهِدِكَ وَنَبِيِّكَ وَنَذِيْرِكَ وَاَمِيْنِكَ وَمَكِيْنِكَ\nWA SHAAHIDIKA WA NABIYYIKA WA NADHEERIKA WA AMEENIKA WA MAKEENIK\nYour witness, Your Prophet, Your warner, Your trustee, Your firmly established (in truth),\nوَنَجِيِّكَ وَنَجِيْبِكَ وَحَبِيْبِكَ وَخَلِيْلِكَ وَصَفِيِّكَ\nWA NAJIYYIKA WA NAJEEBIKA WA HABEEBIKA WA KHALEELIKA WA SAFIYYIK\nYour confidant, Your elite, Your most beloved, Your friend, Your choice,\nوَصَفْوَتِكَ وَخَآصَّتِكَ وَخَالِصَتِكَ وَرَحْمَتِكَ\nWA SAFWATIKA WA KHAASSATIKA WA KHAALISATIKA WA RAHMATIK\nYour notable, Your elect, Your well-chosen, Your mercy,\nوَخَيْرِ خِيَرَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nWA KHAYRI KHIYARATIKA MIN KHALQIK\nthe best of Your chosen ones among Your created beings,\nنَبِيِّ الرَّحْمَةِ وَخَازِنِ الْمَغْفِرَةِ\nNABIYYIR RAHMATI WA KHAAZINIL MAGHFIRAH\nthe Prophet of mercy, the storer of forgiveness,\nوَقَاۤئِدِ الْخَيْرِ وَالْبَرَكَةِ\nWA QAA'IDIL KHAYRI WAL BARAKAH\nthe leader to goodliness and blessing,\nوَمُنْقِذِ الْعِبَادِ مِنَ الْهَلَكَةِ بِاِذْنِكَ\nWA MUNQIDHIL I'BAADI MINAL HALAKATI BI-IDHNIK\nthe savior of the servants (of Almighty Allah) from perdition by Your permission,\nوَدَاعِيْهِمْ اِلٰى دِيْنِكَ الْقَيِّمِ بِاَمْرِكَ\nWA DAA'EEHIM ILAA DEENIKAL QAYYIMI BI-AMRIK\nthe caller of them to Your religion, the custodian by Your order,\nاَوَّلِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ مِيْثَاقًا وَاٰخِرِهِمْ مَبْعَثًا\nAWWALIN NABIYYEENA MEETHAAQAN WA AAKHIRIHIM MAB'ATHAA\nthe first Prophet to make the covenant, and the last Prophet to be sent (to humanity),\nالَّذِيْ غَمَسْتَهٗ فِيْ بَحْرِ الْفَضِيْلَةِ\nALLADHEE GHAMASTAHOO FEE BAHRIL FADEELAH\nwhom You have immersed in the ocean of virtue,\nوَالْمَنْزِلَةِ الْجَلِيْلَةِ وَالدَّرَجَةِ الرَّفِيْعَةِ\nWAL MANZILATIL JALEELATI WAD DARAJATIR RAFEE'AH\nin the lofty rank, in the elevated level,\nوَالْمَرْتَبَةِ الْخَطِيْرَةِ\nWAL MARTABATIL KHATEERAH\nand in the exalted position;\nوَاَوْدَعْتَهُ الْاَصْلَابَ الطَّاهِرَةَ\nWA AWDA'TAHUL ASLAABAT TAAHIRAH\nand whom You entrusted in the pure loins\nوَنَقَلْتَهٗ مِنْهَاۤ اِلَى الْاَرْحَامِ الْمُطَهَّرَةِ\nWA NAQALTAHOO MINHAA ILAL ARHAAMIL MUTAHHARAH\nand moved from them to the immaculate wombs,\nلُطْفًا مِنْكَ لَهٗ وَتَحَنُّنًا مِنْكَ عَلَيْهِ\nLUTFAN MINKA LAHOO WA TAHANNUNAN MINKA A'LAYH\nout of Your kindness to him and Your compassion to him.\nاِذْ وَكَّلْتَ لِصَوْنِهٖ وَحِرَاسَتِهٖ وَحِفْظِهٖ\nIDH WAKKALTA LISAWNIHEE WA HIRAASATIHEE WA HIFZIH\nIn order to safeguard, to shield, and to protect him,\nوَحِيَاطَتِهٖ مِنْ قُدْرَتِكَ عَيْنًا عَاصِمَةً\nWA HIYAATATIHEE MIN QUDRATIKA A'YNAN A'ASIMAH\nand to defend him, You assigned, out of Your omnipotence, a protective lookout over him,\nحَجَبْتَ بِهَا عَنْهُ مَدَانِسَ الْعَهْرِ وَمَعَاۤئِبَ السِّفَاحِ\nHAJABTA BIHAA A'NHU MADAANISAL A'HRI WA MA'AA'IBAS SIFAAH\nto keep him from the impurities of adultery and from the defects of fornication;\nحَتّٰى رَفَعْتَ بِهٖ نَوَاظِرَ الْعِبَادِ\nHATTAA RAFA'TA BIHEE NAWAAZIRAL I'BAAD\nthus, You raised the sights of the servants through him\nوَاَحْيَيْتَ بِهٖ مَيْتَ الْبِلَادِ\nWA AHYAYTA BIHEE MAYTAL BILAAD\nand revived the derelict lands through him,\nبِاَنْ كَشَفْتَ عَنْ نُوْرِ وِلَادَتِهٖ ظُلَمَ الْاَسْتَارِ\nBI-AN KASHAFTA A'N NOORI WILAADATIHEE ZULAMAL ASTAAR\nwhen You removed the screening murk by the light of his birth\nوَاَلْبَسْتَ حَرَمَكَ بِهٖ حُلَلَ الْاَنْوَارِ\nWA ALBASTA HARAMAKA BIHEE HULALAL ANWAAR\nand dressed Your Holy Precinct the garments of brightness through him.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَكَمَا خَصَصْتَهٗ بِشَرَفِ هٰذِهِ الْمَرْتَبَةِ الْكَرِيْمَةِ\nALLAAHUMMA FAKAMAA KHASASTAHOO BISHARAFI HAADHIHIL MARTABATIL KAREEMAH\nO Allah, as You have given him exclusively the honor of this noble rank\nوَذُخْرِ هٰذِهِ الْمَنْقَبَةِ الْعَظِيْمَةِ\nWA DHUKHRI HAADHIHIL MANQABATIL A'ZEEMAH\nand the privilege of this great merit,\nصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ كَمَا وَفٰى بِعَهْدِكَ وَبَلَّغَ رِسَالَاتِكَ\nSALLI A'LAYHI KAMAA WAFAA BI-A'HDIKA WA BALLAGHA RISAALAATIK\n(please do) bless him, for he fulfilled his covenant to You, conveyed all Your messages,\nوَقَاتَلَ اَهْلَ الْجُحُوْدِ عَلٰى تَوْحِيْدِكَ\nWA QAATALA AHLAL JUHOODI A'LAA TAWHEEDIK\nfought against the infidels in order to prove Your Oneness,\nوَقَطَعَ رَحِمَ الْكُفْرِ فِيْۤ اِعْزَازِ دِيْنِكَ\nWA QATA'A RAHIMAL KUFRI FEE I'ZAAZI DEENIK\nexterminated the womb of atheism in order to strengthen Your religion,\nوَلَبِسَ ثَوْبَ الْبَلْوٰى فِيْ مُجَاهَدَةِ اَعْدَاۤئِكَ\nWA LABISA THAWBAL BALWAA FEE MUJAAHADATI A'DAA'IK\nand dressed himself the garb of misfortune in order to struggle against Your enemies.\nوَاَوْجَبْتَ لَهٗ بِكُلِّ اَذًى مَسَّهٗ\nWA AWJABTA LAHOO BIKULLI ADHAN MASSAH\nHence, You have given him, as recompense for any harm that inflicted him,\nاَوْ كَيْدٍ اَحَسَّ بِهٖ مِنَ الْفِئَةِ الَّتِيْ حَاوَلَتْ قَتْلَهٗ\nAW KAYDIN AHASSA BIHEE MINAL FI'ATIL LATEE HAAWALAT QATLAH\nor any trickery that he faced from the faction who tried to assassinate him,\nفَضِيْلَةً تَفُوْقُ الْفَضَاۤئِلَ\nFADEELATAN TAFOOQUL FADAA'IL\na merit that excels all other merits\nوَيَمْلِكُ بِهَا الْجَزِيْلَ مِنْ نَوَالِكَ\nWA YAMLIKU BIHAL JAZEELA MIN NAWAALIK\nand due to which he possessed Your abundant gifts.\nوَقَدْ اَسَرَّ الْحَسْرَةَ وَاَخْفَى الزَّفْرَةَ وَتَجَرَّعَ الْغُصَّةَ\nWA QAD ASARRAL HASRATA WA AKHFAZ ZAFRATA WA TAJARRA'AL GHUSSAH\nHe hid his sadness, concealed his grief, swallowed the pang,\nوَلَمْ يَتَخَطَّ مَا مَثَّلَ لَهٗ وَحْيُكَ\nWA LAM YATAKHATTA MAA MATHTHALA LAHOO WAHYUK\nand never did he violate the instructions of Your Revelation.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلٰۤى اَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ صَلَاةً تَرْضَاهَا لَهُمْ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAYHI WA A'LAA AHLI BAYTIHEE SALAATAN TARDAAHAA LAHUM\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings upon him and his Household, blessings that You please for them,\nوَبَلِّغْهُمْ مِنَّا تَحِيَّةً كَثِيْرَةً وَسَلَامًا\nWA BALLIGH-HUM MINNAA TAHIYYATAN KATHEERATAN WA SALAAMAA\nand convey our abundant greetings and compliments to them,\nوَاٰتِنَا مِنْ لَدُنْكَ فِيْ مُوَالَاتِهِمْ فَضْلًا وَاِحْسَانًا\nWA AATINAA MIN LADUNKA FEE MUWAALAATIHIM FADLAN WA IHSAANAA\nand give us, from You, on account of our loyalty to them, favors, kindness,\nوَرَحْمَةً وَغُفْرَانًا اِنَّكَ ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWA RAHMATAN WA GHUFRAANAN INNAKA DHUL FADLIL A'ZEEM\nmercy, and forgiveness. Verily, You are the Lord of great favor.\nThen pray four units, two at a time, with any surahs you wish. After the prayer, recite [Tasbih al-Zahra](I9), then say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّكَ قُلْتَ لِنَبِيِّكَ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA INNAKA QULTA LINABIYYIKA MUHAMMADIN SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nO Allah, You have said to Your Prophet Muhammad, may Allah bless him and his Household:\nوَلَوْ اَنَّهُمْ اِذْ ظَلَمُوْا اَنْفُسَهُمْ جَاۤءُوْكَ\nWA LAW ANNAHUM IDH ZALAMOO ANFUSAHUM JAA'OOK\n“And had they, when they were unjust to themselves, come to you\nفَاسْتَغْفَرُوا اللّٰهَ وَاسْتَغْفَرَ لَهُمُ الرَّسُوْلُ\nFASTAGHFARULLAAHA WASTAGHFARA LAHUMUR RASOOL\nand asked forgiveness of Allah and the Messenger had (also) asked forgiveness for them,\nلَوَجَدُوا اللّٰهَ تَوَّابًا رَحِيْمًا\nLAWAJADULLAAHA TAWWAABAN RAHEEMAA\nthey would have found Allah Oft-returning (to mercy), Merciful.”\nوَلَمْ اَحْضُرْ زَمَانَ رَسُوْلِكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ السَّلَامُ\nWA LAM AHDUR ZAMAANA RASOOLIKA A'LAYHI WA AALIHIS SALAAM\nI was not present at the age of Your Messenger, peace be upon him and his Household.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَقَدْ زُرْتُهٗ رَاغِبًا تَاۤئِبًا مِنْ سَيِّئِ عَمَلِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA WA QAD ZURTUHOO RAAGHIBAN TAA'IBAN MIN SAYYI'I A'MALEE\nO Allah, I have visited him desiring, repenting from my ill deeds,\nوَمُسْتَغْفِرًا لَكَ مِنْ ذُنُوْبِيْ\nWA MUSTAGHFIRAN LAKA MIN DHUNOOBEE\nimploring forgiveness of my sins,\nوَمُقِرًّا لَكَ بِهَا وَاَنْتَ اَعْلَمُ بِهَا مِنِّيْ\nWA MUQIRRAN LAKA BIHAA WA ANTA A'LAMU BIHAA MINNEE\nconfessing of my having committed these sins although You know them more than I do,\nوَمُتَوَجِّهًا اِلَيْكَ بِنَبِيِّكَ نَبِيِّ الرَّحْمَةِ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nWA MUTAWAJJIHAN ILAYKA BINABIYYIKA NABIYYIR RAHMATI SALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nand turning my face towards You in the name of Your Prophet, the Prophet of Mercy, may Your blessings be upon him and his Household.\nفَاجْعَلْنِي اللّٰهُمَّ بِمُحَمَّدٍ وَاَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ\nFAJ'ALNILLAAHUMMA BIMUHAMMADIN WA AHLI BAYTIH\nO Allah, in the name of Muhammad and his Household, (please do) make me\nعِنْدَكَ وَجِيْهًا فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ وَمِنَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nI'NDAKA WAJEEHAN FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRATI WA MINAL MUQARRABEEN\nillustrious with You in this world as well as the Next World and one of those brought near to You.\nيَا مُحَمَّدُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ بِاَبِيْۤ اَنْتَ وَاُمِّيْ\nYAA MUHAMMADU YAA RASOOLALLAAHI BI-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE\nO Muhammad! O Messenger of Allah! May Allah accept my father and mother as ransoms for you!\nيَا نَبِيَّ اللّٰهِ يَا سَيِّدَ خَلْقِ اللّٰهِ\nYAA NABIYYALLAAHI YAA SAYYIDA KHALQILLAAH\nO Prophet of Allah! O chief of all created beings of Allah!\nاِنِّيْۤ اَتَوَجَّهُ بِكَ اِلَى اللّٰهِ رَبِّكَ وَرَبِّيْ\nINNEE ATAWAJJAHU BIKA ILALLAAHI RABBIKA WA RABBEE\nThrough you do I turn my face towards Allah, your and my Lord,\nلِيَغْفِرَ لِيْ ذُنُوْبِيْ وَيَتَقَبَّلَ مِنِّيْ عَمَلِيْ\nLIYAGHFIRA LEE DHUNOOBEE WA YATAQABBALA MINNEE A'MALEE\nso that He may forgive my sins, accept my deeds,\nوَيَقْضِيَ لِيْ حَوَاۤئِجِيْ\nWA YAQDIYA LEE HAWAA'IJEE\nand settle my requests.\nفَكُنْ لِيْ شَفِيْعًا عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ وَرَبِّيْ\nFAKUN LEE SHAFEE'AN I'NDA RABBIKA WA RABBEE\nTherefore, be my interceder before your and my Lord,\nفَنِعْمَ الْمَسْئُوْلُ الْمَوْلٰى رَبِّيْ\nFANI'MAL MAS'OOLUL MAWLAA RABBEE\nfor my Lord, the Master, is the best besought\nوَنِعْمَ الشَّفِيْعُ اَنْتَ يَا مُحَمَّدُ\nWA NI'MASH SHAFEE'U ANTA YAA MUHAMMAD\nand you are the best interceder, O Muhammad.\nعَلَيْكَ وَعَلٰۤى اَهْلِ بَيْتِكَ السَّلَامُ\nA'LAYKA WA A'LAA AHLI BAYTIKAS SALAAM\nMay peace be upon you and upon your Household.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاَوْجِبْ لِيْ مِنْكَ الْمَغْفِرَةَ وَالرَّحْمَةَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA AWJIB LEE MINKAL MAGHFIRATA WAR RAHMAH\nO Allah, (please do) confer upon me forgiveness and mercy from Your Presence,\nوَالرِّزْقَ الْوَاسِعَ الطَّيِّبَ النَّافِعَ\nWAR RIZQAL WAASI'AT TAYYIBAN NAAFI'\nand sustenance that is outgoing, good, and beneficial,\nكَمَاۤ اَوْجَبْتَ لِمَنْ اَتٰى نَبِيَّكَ مُحَمَّدًا صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nKAMAA AWJABTA LIMAN ATAA NABIYYAKA MUHAMMADAN SALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nin the same way as You conferred upon him who came to Your Prophet, Muhammad, may Your blessings be upon him and his Household,\nوَهُوَ حَيٌّ فَاَقَرَّ لَهٗ بِذُنُوْبِهٖ\nWA HUWA HAYYUN FA-AQARRA LAHOO BIDHUNOOBIH\nwhen he was alive, and confessed of his sins to him,\nوَاسْتَغْفَرَ لَهٗ رَسُوْلُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ السَّلَامُ\nWASTAGHFARA LAHOO RASOOLUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIHIS SALAAM\nand Your Messenger, peace be upon him and his Household, prayed for his forgiveness,\nفَغَفَرْتَ لَهٗ بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nFAGHAFARTA LAHOO BIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nand You did forgive him out of Your mercy, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَقَدْ اَمَّلْتُكَ وَرَجَوْتُكَ وَقُمْتُ بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA QAD AMMALTUKA WA RAJAWTUKA WA QUMTU BAYNA YADAYK\nO Allah, I now put my hope in You, hope for You, and stand before You,\nوَرَغِبْتُ اِلَيْكَ عَمَّنْ سِوَاكَ\nWA RAGHIBTU ILAYKA A'MMAN SIWAAK\nand I desire You rather than anyone else,\nوَقَدْ اَمَّلْتُ جَزِيْلَ ثَوَابِكَ\nWA QAD AMMALTU JAZEELA THAWAABIK\nand I hope for Your abundant reward.\nوَاِنِّيْ لَمُقِرٌّ غَيْرُ مُنْكِرٍ\nWA INNEE LAMUQIRRUN GHAYRU MUNKIR\nI confess of my sins and I do not deny them,\nوَتَاۤئِبٌ اِلَيْكَ مِمَّا اقْتَرَفْتُ\nWA TAA'IBUN ILAYKA MIMMAQ TARAFT\nI repent to You from whatever I have committed,\nوَعَاۤئِذٌ بِكَ فِيْ هٰذَا الْمَقَامِ مِمَّا قَدَّمْتُ مِنَ الْاَعْمَالِ\nWA A'A'IDHUN BIKA FEE HAADHAL MAQAAMI MIMMAA QADDAMTU MINAL A'MAAL\nand I seek refuge with You, in this position, from the deeds that I have committed,\nالَّتِيْ تَقَدَّمْتَ اِلَيَّ فِيْهَا وَنَهَيْتَنِيْ عَنْهَا\nALLATEE TAQADDAMTA ILAYYA FEEHAA WA NAHAYTANEE A'NHAA\nalthough You had first warned me against them, forbidden me from them,\nوَاَوْعَدْتَ عَلَيْهَا الْعِقَابَ\nWA AW'ADTA A'LAYHAL I'QAAB\nand threatened me with punishment for them.\nوَاَعُوْذُ بِكَرَمِ وَجْهِكَ\nWA A'OODHU BIKARAMI WAJHIK\nAnd I seek shelter with the nobility of Your Face\nاَنْ تُقِيْمَنِيْ مَقَامَ الْخِزْيِ وَالذُّلِّ\nAN TUQEEMANEE MAQAAMAL KHIZYI WADH DHULL\nlest You impose upon me the situation of disgrace and humility\nيَوْمَ تُهْتَكُ فِيْهِ الْاَسْتَارُ\nYAWMA TUHTAKU FEEHIL ASTAAR\non the day when the veils will be torn,\nوَتَبْدُوْ فِيْهِ الْاَسْرَارُ وَالْفَضَاۤئِحُ\nWA TABDOO FEEHIL ASRAARU WAL FADAA'IH\nthe secrets and scandals will be disclosed,\nوَتَرْعَدُ فِيْهِ الْفَرَاۤئِصُ\nWA TAR'ADU FEEHIL FARAA'IS\nand the muscles will writhe with fear;\nيَوْمَ الْحَسْرَةِ وَالنَّدَامَةِ يَوْمَ الْاٰفِكَةِ يَوْمَ الْاٰزِفَةِ\nYAWMAL HASRATI WAN NADAAMATI YAWMAL AAFIKATI YAWMAL AAZIFAH\non the day of regret and remorse, the day of exposing the liars, the day of the approaching doom,\nيَوْمَ التَّغَابُنِ يَوْمَ الْفَصْلِ يَوْمَ الْجَزَاۤءِ\nYAWMAT TAGHAABUNI YAWMAL FASLI YAWMAL JAZAA'\nthe day of mutual loss, the day of separation, the day of punishment,\nيَوْمًا كَانَ مِقْدَارُهٗ خَمْسِيْنَ اَلْفَ سَنَةٍ\nYAWMAN KAANA MIQDAARUHOO KHAMSEENA ALFA SANAH\nthe day the measure of which is fifty thousand years,\nيَوْمَ النَّفْخَةِ يَوْمَ تَرْجُفُ الرَّاجِفَةُ تَتْبَعُهَا الرَّادِفَةُ\nYAWMAN NAFKHATI YAWMA TARJUFUR RAAJIFATU TATBA'UHAR RAADIFAH\nthe day of the blowing, the day on which the quaking land shall quake followed by oft-repeated commotions,\nيَوْمَ النَّشْرِ يَوْمَ الْعَرْضِ\nYAWMAN NASHRI YAWMAL A'RD\nthe day of raising the dead, the day of exposition,\nيَوْمَ يَقُوْمُ النَّاسُ لِرَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nYAWMA YAQOOMUN NAASU LIRABBIL A'ALAMEEN\nthe day when all mankind stand before the Lord of the Worlds,\nيَوْمَ يَفِرُّ الْمَرْءُ مِنْ اَخِيْهِ\nYAWMA YAFIRRUL MAR'U MIN AKHEEH\nthe day when a man flees from his brother,\nوَاُمِّهٖ وَاَبِيْهِ وَصَاحِبَتِهٖ وَبَنِيْهِ\nWA UMMIHEE WA ABEEHI WA SAAHIBATIHEE WA BANEEH\nhis mother, his father, his wife, and his children,\nيَوْمَ تَشَقَّقُ الْاَرْضُ وَاَكْنَافُ السَّمَاۤءِ\nYAWMA TASHAQQAQUL ARDU WA AKNAAFUS SAMAA'\nthe day when the earth and the sides of the heavens will split asunder,\nيَوْمَ تَاْتِيْ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ تُجَادِلُ عَنْ نَفْسِهَا\nYAWMA TA'TEE KULLU NAFSIN TUJAADILU A'N NAFSIHAA\nthe day when every soul will come pleading for itself,\nيَوْمَ يُرَدُّوْنَ اِلَى اللّٰهِ فَيُنَبِّئُهُمْ بِمَا عَمِلُوْا\nYAWMA YURADDOONA ILALLAAHI FAYUNABBI'UHUM BIMAA A'MILOO\nthe day when they will be returned to Allah Who will inform them of what they did,\nيَوْمَ لَا يُغْنِيْ مَوْلًى عَنْ مَوْلًى شَيْئًا وَلَا هُمْ يُنْصَرُوْنَ\nYAWMA LAA YUGHNEE MAWLAN A'N MAWLAN SHAY'AN WA LAA HUM YUNSAROON\nthe day when a friend can in naught avail his friend, nor can they be helped,\nاِلَّا مَنْ رَحِمَ اللّٰهُ اِنَّهٗ هُوَ الْعَزِيْزُ الرَّحِيْمُ\nILLAA MAN RAHIMALLAAHU INNAHOO HUWAL A'ZEEZUR RAHEEM\nsave him on whom Allah will have mercy. Lo! He is the Mighty, the Merciful,\nيَوْمَ يُرَدُّوْنَ اِلٰى عَالِمِ الْغَيْبِ وَالشَّهَادَةِ\nYAWMA YURADDOONA ILAA A'ALIMIL GHAYBI WASH SHAHAADAH\nthe day when they will be returned to the Knower of the invisible and the visible,\nيَوْمَ يُرَدُّوْنَ اِلَى اللّٰهِ مَوْلَاهُمُ الْحَقِّ\nYAWMA YURADDOONA ILALLAAHI MAWLAAHUMUL HAQQ\nthe day when they will be restored to Allah, their Lord, the True,\nيَوْمَ يَخْرُجُوْنَ مِنَ الْاَجْدَاثِ سِرَاعًا\nYAWMA YAKHRUJOONA MINAL AJDAATHI SIRAA'AA\nthe day when they come forth from the graves in haste,\nكَاَنَّهُمْ اِلٰى نُصُبٍ يُوْفِضُوْنَ\nKA-ANNAHUM ILAA NUSUBIN YOOFIDOON\nas racing to a goal\nوَكَاَنَّهُمْ جَرَادٌ مُنْتَشِرٌ\nWA KA-ANNAHUM JARAADUN MUNTASHIR\nand as locusts spreading abroad,\nمُهْطِعِيْنَ اِلَى الدَّاعِ اِلَى اللّٰهِ\nMUHTI'EENA ILAD DAA'I ILALLAAH\nhastening toward the Summoner, to Allah,\nيَوْمَ الْوَاقِعَةِ يَوْمَ تُرَجُّ الْاَرْضُ رَجًّا\nYAWMAL WAAQI'ATI YAWMA TURAJJUL ARDU RAJJAA\nthe day of the event inevitable, the day when the earth will be shaken with a shock,\nيَوْمَ تَكُوْنُ السَّمَاۤءُ كَالْمُهْلِ وَتَكُوْنُ الْجِبَالُ كَالْعِهْنِ\nYAWMA TAKOONUS SAMAA'U KAL MUHLI WA TAKOONUL JIBAALU KAL I'HN\nthe day when the sky will become as molten copper and the hills become as flakes of wool,\nوَلَا يَسْاَلُ حَمِيْمٌ حَمِيْمًا\nWA LAA YAS'ALU HAMEEMUN HAMEEMAA\nand no familiar friend will ask a question of his friend,\nيَوْمَ الشَّاهِدِ وَالْمَشْهُوْدِ\nYAWMASH SHAAHIDI WAL MASH-HOOD\nthe day of the witness and that whereunto he bears testimony,\nيَوْمَ تَكُوْنُ الْمَلَاۤئِكَةُ صَفًّا صَفًّا\nYAWMA TAKOONUL MALAA'IKATU SAFFAN SAFFAA\nand the day when the angels will come rank on rank.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ ارْحَمْ مَوْقِفِيْ فِيْ ذٰلِكَ الْيَوْمِ\nALLAAHUMMAR HAM MAWQIFEE FEE DHAALIKAL YAWM\nO Allah, (please do) have mercy upon my situation on that day\nبِمَوْقِفِيْ فِيْ هٰذَا الْيَوْمِ\nBIMAWQIFEE FEE HAADHAL YAWM\nfor my situation on this day,\nوَلَا تُخْزِنِيْ فِيْ ذٰلِكَ الْمَوْقِفِ بِمَا جَنَيْتُ عَلٰى نَفْسِيْ\nWA LAA TUKHZINEE FEE DHAALIKAL MAWQIFI BIMAA JANAYTU A'LAA NAFSEE\nand do not disgrace me at that situation for the wrongdoings that I have committed against myself.\nوَاجْعَلْ يَا رَبِّ فِيْ ذٰلِكَ الْيَوْمِ مَعَ اَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ مُنْطَلَقِيْ\nWAJ'AL YAA RABBI FEE DHAALIKAL YAWMI MA'A AWLIYAA'IKA MUNTALAQEE\nO my Lord, (please do) make my going, on that day, be with Your intimate servants,\nوَفِيْ زُمْرَةِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ مَحْشَرِيْ\nWA FEE ZUMRATI MUHAMMADIN WA AHLI BAYTIHEE A'LAYHIMUS SALAAMU MAHSHAREE\nand my gathering be in the company of Muhammad and his Household, peace be upon them;\nوَاجْعَلْ حَوْضَهٗ مَوْرِدِيْ\nWAJ'AL HAWDAHOO MAWRIDEE\nmake his Pond my arrival point,\nوَفِي الْغُرِّ الْكِرَامِ مَصْدَرِيْ\nWA FIL GHURRIL KIRAAMI MASDAREE\nand my departure be among the honorable, white-forehead group,\nوَاَعْطِنِيْ كِتَابِيْ بِيَمِيْنِيْ حَتّٰىۤ اَفُوْزَ بِحَسَنَاتِيْ\nWA A'TINEE KITAABEE BIYAMEENEE HATTAA AFOOZA BIHASANAATEE\nand give me my Record (of deeds) in my right hand so that I will succeed due to my good deeds,\nوَتُبَيِّضَ بِهٖ وَجْهِيْ\nWA TUBAYYIDA BIHEE WAJHEE\nthat You will make my face white with it,\nوَتُيَسِّرَ بِهٖ حِسَابِيْ\nWA TUYASSIRA BIHEE HISAABEE\nmake easy for me my reckoning with it,\nوَتُرَجِّحَ بِهٖ مِيْزَانِيْ\nWA TURAJJIHA BIHEE MEEZAANEE\nmake my pan of the Scale (of deeds) outweigh with it,\nوَاَمْضِيَ مَعَ الْفَاۤئِزِيْنَ مِنْ عِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِيْنَ\nWA AMDIYA MA'AL FAA'IZEENA MIN I'BAADIKAS SAALIHEEN\nand that I will go with the triumphant ones among Your righteous servants\nاِلٰى رِضْوَانِكَ وَجِنَانِكَ اِلٰهَ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nILAA RIDWAANIKA WA JINAANIKA ILAAHAL A'ALAMEEN\nto Your Pleasure and gardens of Paradise, O God of the Worlds!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ اَنْ تَفْضَحَنِيْ فِيْ ذٰلِكَ الْيَوْمِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE A'OODHU BIKA MIN AN TAFDAHANEE FEE DHAALIKAL YAWM\nO Allah, I do seek Your protection lest You may expose me on that day\nبَيْنَ يَدَيِ الْخَلَاۤئِقِ بِجَرِيْرَتِيْ\nBAYNA YADAYIL KHALAA'IQI BIJAREERATEE\nin the presence of Your creatures because of my sins,\nاَوْ اَنْ اَلْقَى الْخِزْيَ وَالنَّدَامَةَ بِخَطِيْۤئَتِيْ\nAW AN ALQAL KHIZYA WAN NADAAMATA BIKHATEE'ATEE\nor I may encounter disgrace and regret due to my wrongdoings,\nاَوْ اَنْ تُظْهِرَ فِيْهِ سَيِّئَاتِيْ عَلٰى حَسَنَاتِيْ\nAW AN TUZHIRA FEEHI SAYYI'AATEE A'LAA HASANAATEE\nor You may make my evildoings outweigh my good deeds,\nاَوْ اَنْ تُنَوِّهَ بَيْنَ الْخَلَاۤئِقِ بِاسْمِيْ\nAW AN TUNAWWIHA BAYNAL KHALAA'IQI BISMEE\nor You may announce my name amongst Your creatures.\nيَا كَرِيْمُ يَا كَرِيْمُ الْعَفْوَ الْعَفْوَ السَّتْرَ السَّتْرَ\nYAA KAREEMU YAA KAREEMUL A'FWAL A'FWAS SATRAS SATR\nO All-generous, O All-generous, (I beg You for) pardon, pardon, (I beg You for) covering, covering (my evildoings).\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ اَنْ يَكُوْنَ فِيْ ذٰلِكَ الْيَوْمِ\nALLAAHUMMA WA A'OODHU BIKA MIN AN YAKOONA FEE DHAALIKAL YAWM\nO Allah, I also seek Your protection lest, on that day,\nفِيْ مَوَاقِفِ الْاَشْرَارِ مَوْقِفِيْ\nFEE MAWAAQIFIL ASHRAARI MAWQIFEE\nmy standing be with the line of the evil,\nاَوْ فِيْ مَقَامِ الْاَشْقِيَاۤءِ مَقَامِيْ\nAW FEE MAQAAMIL ASHQIYAA'I MAQAAMEE\nor my place with the row of the wretched ones.\nوَاِذَا مَيَّزْتَ بَيْنَ خَلْقِكَ\nWA IDHAA MAYYAZTA BAYNA KHALQIK\nWhen You shall distinguish between Your creatures\nفَسُقْتَ كُلًّا بِاَعْمَالِهِمْ زُمَرًا اِلٰى مَنَازِلِهِمْ\nFASUQTA KULLAN BI-A'MAALIHIM ZUMARAN ILAA MANAAZILIHIM\nand drive each group, according to their deeds, to their final abodes in groups,\nفَسُقْنِيْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ فِيْ عِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِيْنَ\nFASUQNEE BIRAHMATIKA FEE I'BAADIKAS SAALIHEEN\n(please do) drive me, out of Your mercy, with the group of Your righteous servants,\nوَفِيْ زُمْرَةِ اَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ الْمُتَّقِيْنَ\nWA FEE ZUMRATI AWLIYAA'IKAL MUTTAQEEN\nand with the group of Your pious, intimate servants,\nاِلٰى جَنَّاتِكَ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nILAA JANNAATIKA YAA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nto the gardens of Your Paradise, O Lord of the Worlds!\nThen bid the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) farewell:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA RASOOLALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْبَشِيْرُ النَّذِيْرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL BASHEERUN NADHEER\nPeace be upon you, O conveyor of good tidings (to the believers) and warner (against Allah’s chastisement).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا السِّرَاجُ الْمُنِيْرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAS SIRAAJUL MUNEER\nPeace be upon you, O light-giving torch.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا السَّفِيْرُ بَيْنَ اللّٰهِ وَبَيْنَ خَلْقِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAS SAFEERU BAYNALLAAHI WA BAYNA KHALQIH\nPeace be upon you, O envoy between Allah and His creatures.\nاَشْهَدُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ اَنَّكَ كُنْتَ نُوْرًا\nASH-HADU YAA RASOOLALLAAHI ANNAKA KUNTA NOORAA\nI bear witness, O Messenger of Allah, that you were light\nفِي الْاَصْلَابِ الشَّامِخَةِ وَالْاَرْحَامِ الْمُطَهَّرَةِ\nFIL ASLAABISH SHAAMIKHATI WAL ARHAAMIL MUTAHHARAH\nin the lofty loins and purified wombs.\nلَمْ تُنَجِّسْكَ الْجَاهِلِيَّةُ بِاَنْجَاسِهَا\nLAM TUNAJJISKAL JAAHILIYYATU BI-ANJAASIHAA\nThe ignorance could not stain you with its impurities\nوَلَمْ تُلْبِسْكَ مِنْ مُدْلَهِمَّاتِ ثِيَابِهَا\nWA LAM TULBISKA MIN MUDLAHIMMAATI THIYAABIHAA\nor dress you in its gloomy garbs.\nوَاَشْهَدُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ\nWA ASH-HADU YAA RASOOLALLAAH\nI also bear witness, O Messenger of Allah,\nاَنِّيْ مُؤْمِنٌ بِكَ وَبِالْاَئِمَّةِ مِنْ اَهْلِ بَيْتِكَ\nANNEE MU'MINUN BIKA WA BIL A'IMMATI MIN AHLI BAYTIK\nthat I have faith in you and in the Imams from your Household,\nمُوْقِنٌ بِجَمِيْعِ مَاۤ اَتَيْتَ بِهٖ رَاضٍ مُؤْمِنٌ\nMOOQINUN BIJAMEE'I MAA ATAYTA BIHEE RAADIN MU'MIN\nand I believe in all that which you have brought, satisfactorily and faithfully.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ الْاَئِمَّةَ مِنْ اَهْلِ بَيْتِكَ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAL A'IMMATA MIN AHLI BAYTIK\nAnd I bear witness that the Imams from your Household\nاَعْلَامُ الْهُدٰى وَالْعُرْوَةُ الْوُثْقٰى\nA'LAAMUL HUDAA WAL U'RWATUL WUTHQAA\nare the signs of (true) guidance, the Firmest Handle,\nوَالْحُجَّةُ عَلٰۤى اَهْلِ الدُّنْيَا\nWAL HUJJATU A'LAA AHLID DUNYAA\nand the arguments against the inhabitants of this world.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا تَجْعَلْهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنْ زِيَارَةِ نَبِيِّكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ'ALHU AAKHIRAL A'HDI MIN ZIYAARATI NABIYYIKA A'LAYHI WA AALIHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, (please) do not make it the last of my pilgrimage to (the tomb of) Your Prophet, peace be upon him and his Household.\nوَاِنْ تَوَفَّيْتَنِيْ فَاِنِّيْۤ اَشْهَدُ فِيْ مَمَاتِيْ\nWA IN TAWAFFAYTANEE FA-INNEE ASH-HADU FEE MAMAATEE\nIf You decide to grasp my soul, I will bear witness in my death\nعَلٰى مَاۤ اَشْهَدُ عَلَيْهِ فِيْ حَيَاتِيْۤ\nA'LAA MAA ASH-HADU A'LAYHI FEE HAYAATEE\nto the same that I have borne witness to in my lifetime:\nاَنَّكَ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ وَحْدَكَ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَكَ\nANNAKA ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA WAHDAKA LAA SHAREEKA LAK\nthat You are verily Allah; there is no god save You, alone without having any associate,\nوَاَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُكَ وَرَسُوْلُكَ\nWA ANNA MUHAMMADAN A'BDUKA WA RASOOLUK\nthat Muhammad is Your servant and Messenger,\nوَاَنَّ الْاَئِمَّةَ مِنْ اَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ اَوْلِيَاؤُكَ وَاَنْصَارُكَ\nWA ANNAL A'IMMATA MIN AHLI BAYTIHEE AWLIYAA'UKA WA ANSAARUK\nand that the Imams from his Household are Your intimate servants, Your supporters,\nوَحُجَجُكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ وَخُلَفَاۤؤُكَ فِيْ عِبَادِكَ\nWA HUJAJUKA A'LAA KHALQIKA WA KHULAFAA'UKA FEE I'BAADIK\nYour Arguments against Your creatures, Your representatives amongst Your servants,\nوَاَعْلَامُكَ فِي بِلَادِكَ وَخُزَّانُ عِلْمِكَ\nWA A'LAAMUKA FEE BILAADIKA WA KHUZZAANU I'LMIK\nYour signs in Your lands, the custodians of Your knowledge,\nوَحَفَظَةُ سِرِّكَ وَتَرَاجِمَةُ وَحْيِكَ\nWA HAFAZATU SIRRIKA WA TARAAJIMATU WAHYIK\nthe keepers of Your secret, and the interpreters of Your Revelation.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَبَلِّغْ رُوْحَ نَبِيِّكَ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهٖ فِيْ سَاعَتِيْ هٰذِهِ\nWA BALLIGH ROOHA NABIYYIKA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIHEE FEE SAA'ATEE HAADHIH\nand convey to the souls of Your Prophet, Muhammad, and his Household, at this very hour\nوَفِيْ كُلِّ سَاعَةٍ تَحِيَّةً مِنِّيْ وَسَلَامًا\nWA FEE KULLI SAA'ATIN TAHIYYATAN MINNEE WA SALAAMAA\nas well as at all times, greetings and compliments from me.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA RASOOLALLAAHI WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nO Messenger of Allah, peace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nلَا جَعَلَهُ اللّٰهُ اٰخِرَ تَسْلِيْمِيْ عَلَيْكَ\nLAA JA'ALAHULLAAHU AAKHIRA TASLEEMEE A'LAYK\nMay Allah not make this my last greeting to you.",
